OS304 kernel shell. Type help.
os304> help
commands: help echo ls cat stat mounts exit
os304> echo files, pipes and a shell
files, pipes and a shell
os304> ls /etc
- 0600     11 hostname
- 0644     76 motd
os304> cat /etc/motd
Welcome to the OS304 mini kernel.
This file came from the initial RAM disk.
